# Official Keycloak main is the source of truth

`origin` is the GEICO fork (`geico/keycloak`). `upstream` is the official mirror (`keycloak/keycloak`).

When refreshing this branch, always fetch and rebase onto official `main`:

```
git fetch upstream main
git rebase upstream/main
```

Do not `git pull` from `origin` to integrate remote branch history. After a rebase, the local history has rewritten commits, so a later `git push` will be a non-fast-forward reject. Push with `git push --force-with-lease origin HEAD` instead of pulling origin first.

Do not rebase onto `origin/main` or merge origin's default branch unless the user explicitly asks.
